          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-emerald-400 mb-1">STEP 01 • 06:00 AM MON</div>
          <div class="font-bold text-white">RSS Feed Ingestion</div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
            GitHub Actions triggers <code class="text-slate-200">scripts/generate_newsletter.py</code> to pull the past 7 days of advisories from CISA, Krebs on Security, and BleepingComputer.
          </p>
