          <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1.5 leading-relaxed">
            Gemini 4 Argon strips out enterprise-only noise (SCADA, Kubernetes, BGP, data-center appliances) and isolates threats that hit 1–5 person businesses.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-obsidian-950/80 border border-slate-800/90">
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-amber-400 mb-1">STEP 03 • PLAIN ENGLISH</div>
